// OPTIONAL. Only needed if you sign Gitzy with your own Apple Developer account.
// The project builds fine without this file (it uses ad-hoc "Sign to Run Locally" signing).
//
// To use it:
//   1. Copy this file to Local.xcconfig (that name is git-ignored, so your Team ID stays private).
//   2. Fill in the values below.
//   3. In Xcode: Project > Info > Configurations, set Local.xcconfig as the base for Debug and Release.

// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = XXXXXXXXXX
// CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
// CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
